  displayName: Rask Blackhand
  role: 3
  description: 'A Rask combat engineer, named for the soot-black gauntlets of their
    trade. The Blackhand has the Rask Ultima''s health, accuracy and move but lighter
    armor (10 health, Armor Level 1, 75% accuracy, 20 m a move) and fights alone
    (Solo), with a Solntse Laser Rifle (the Rask''s Assault Rifle: 6 damage, penetration
    1, 20 m). Its Repair Kit restores 10 health to a friendly Mechanical soldier
    within 5 m, such as a damaged Stinger or Intimidator, as its action; it can''t
    be used on one at full health. A Specialist, so you can field more than one.'
